        {
          "type": "say",
          "text": "Good afternoon, everyone. Let's get started. As you all know, the Department of Justice has issued a subpoena concerning commission payments made through our international distributors, and we need to provide an initial response and proposed investigation plan next month. Our current response packet describes the matter as an inquiry into distributor commissions, but it does not yet specify a voluntary disclosure, a repayment amount, or an executive-interview protocol. Under my standard review process, I need white-collar, finance, and employment counsel each to give a final recommendation on every open response item today. Once I've heard from all of you, I will record a definitive yes-or-no decision on voluntary disclosure and the other terms, along with implementation commitments, before we end this meeting. So let's begin -- I'd like to hear from each of you on your recommendations regarding voluntary disclosure, any repayment figures, and how we should handle executive interviews. Who wants to start?",
          "speaker": "A1",
          "turn": 0,
          "raw_output": "```json\n{\"type\": \"say\", \"text\": \"Good afternoon, everyone. Let's get started. As you all know, the Department of Justice has issued a subpoena concerning commission payments made through our international distributors, and we need to provide an initial response and proposed investigation plan next month. Our current response packet describes the matter as an inquiry into distributor commissions, but it does not yet specify a voluntary disclosure, a repayment amount, or an executive-interview protocol. Under my standard review process, I need white-collar, finance, and employment counsel each to give a final recommendation on every open response item today. Once I've heard from all of you, I will record a definitive yes-or-no decision on voluntary disclosure and the other terms, along with implementation commitments, before we end this meeting. So let's begin -- I'd like to hear from each of you on your recommendations regarding voluntary disclosure, any repayment figures, and how we should handle executive interviews. Who wants to start?\"}\n```"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
