          "text": "Before we proceed, I need to share something important. I completed a reconciliation of the commission ledger and supporting invoices, and it shows exactly $275,000 in improper payments. I confirmed this amount with controllership yesterday, but it has not yet been added to the investigation materials. I think this figure is directly relevant to our discussion of repayment and voluntary disclosure, so we should factor it in.",
