osure, and it could generate evidence that cuts against the company's cooperation posture. For other executives outside the implicated scope, I recommend standard voluntary interviews with company counsel present.\\n\\nThose are my final recommendations on all three items. I'm ready to hear from Maya and Jordan.\"}"
